[statement]
Reduced from postmarketOS v26.06 over Alpine v3.24 (`main` and
`community`, 2026-11-11), asked for `postmarketos-base-ui-gnome`;
postmarketOS's repository first. `modemmanager` needs `polkit`, which the
package `polkit` carries and `polkit-elogind` provides at its version;
`postmarketos-base-ui-gnome-openrc`, installed for its condition on
`openrc`, needs `polkit-elogind`. apk takes `polkit` for `modemmanager`,
then cannot install `polkit-elogind` beside it, and refuses, where
`polkit-elogind` alone would answer both. Observed; the rule is not yet
known.

